# Main report + dated archive (public verification)

## Report layout (required)

After any handler/skill test run:

1. **MAIN report (always overwritten)**  
   `AGENT LIBRARY/api-skill-e2e-tests/MAIN_REPORT.html`  
   Also synced to: `docs/gptfy-agent-skills-e2e/index.html` (GitHub Pages / public link)

2. **Dated archive (never overwrite)**  
   `AGENT LIBRARY/api-skill-e2e-tests/reports/archive/YYYY-MM-DD_HHMMSS_<slug>.html`

## Report content (detail first)

- Full **Request** + full **Response** for every skill under test
- Date/time + short **why this update**
- No large scoreboards / number dumps

## Generate

```bash
# Full matrix → MAIN + archive
python build_main_report.py

# Handler change → MAIN + archive
python regression_handler.py CaseAgenticSkillsHandler --reason "..."
```

## Share with boss

- Prefer the **public Pages URL** for `docs/gptfy-agent-skills-e2e/` after push
- Or MAIN file on `main` branch in the public GitHub repo
